+                `(num_key, bs, embed_dims)`.
+            value (Tensor): The value tensor with shape
+                `(num_key, bs, embed_dims)`.
+            identity (Tensor): The tensor used for addition, with the
+                same shape as `query`. Default None. If None,
+                `query` will be used.
